# Harness state — .opencode/state/ is a tracked snapshot: ratchet baselines
# (agent-readiness/coupling/coverage/cycle), learned-rules.md, process-rules.md,
# failures.md, iteration-log.md stay committed. Only runtime churn is ignored
# below — caches, indexes, logs, counters, and *.jsonl ledgers. All scoped to
# .opencode/state/ so real project data (e.g. a data/*.jsonl fixture) is never hit.
.opencode/runs/
.opencode/state/archive/
.opencode/state/context-cache/
.opencode/state/tool-output/
.opencode/state/nav-index/
.opencode/state/*.jsonl
.opencode/state/*.log
.opencode/state/*.offset
.opencode/state/lane-router-last.txt
